# Project agent

Before a task, read `AGENTS.md` and follow `.cursor/skills/project-documentation/SKILL.md`.

Before editing, and again when a logical change is ready to save, follow `.cursor/skills/git-workflow/SKILL.md`.

Do not commit files that are outside the current task. Do not force-push. Do not merge into `main` without an explicit request.
